WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:40.129
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:40.399 --> 00:41.399
This is you.

3
00:42.800 --> 00:43.800
And the other woman,

4
00:44.480 --> 00:47.280
the one who later adopted Yong Qi is Professor Liang Huan, isn't it?

5
01:05.720 --> 01:07.640
This is Professor Liang Huan.

6
01:08.320 --> 01:09.360
Until I was eight

7
01:09.760 --> 01:11.000
she was the one who took me in.

8
01:23.000 --> 01:24.439
At a private hospital in England

9
01:24.440 --> 01:25.800
I found several medical records.

10
01:28.200 --> 01:29.200
Auntie Xu.

11
01:31.000 --> 01:33.320
You had a hysterectomy for uterine cancer.

12
01:34.000 --> 01:36.320
And the date is before Xu Feiyu was born.

13
01:44.440 --> 01:45.520
Song Yi.

14
01:46.280 --> 01:47.720
What are you talking about?

15
01:59.600 --> 02:02.000
Liang Huan had surgery at that same hospital.

16
02:02.600 --> 02:03.600
An embryo transfer.

17
02:04.320 --> 02:05.560
Nine months later

18
02:05.960 --> 02:07.800
she had a C-section.

19
02:22.800 --> 02:24.400
The child in this photo

20
02:30.120 --> 02:31.480
is that Xu Feiyu?

21
02:48.920 --> 02:49.920
Yes.

22
02:52.120 --> 02:53.120
It's Xu Feiyu.

23
03:11.320 --> 03:12.320
Back then.

24
03:14.320 --> 03:15.720
Liang Huan and I

25
03:18.240 --> 03:19.279
desperately wanted

26
03:19.280 --> 03:20.920
a child of our own.

27
03:22.880 --> 03:25.280
It was a decision we made together.

28
04:09.280 --> 04:10.280
Then.

29
04:12.720 --> 04:14.840
Song Yang found out about us

30
04:16.920 --> 04:19.560
and he told Liang Huan's parents.

31
04:22.320 --> 04:24.000
It caused a huge scandal.

32
04:25.880 --> 04:26.880
After that

33
04:28.240 --> 04:30.640
they dragged Liang Huan back to Poland.

34
04:35.720 --> 04:36.720
They

35
04:37.720 --> 04:40.400
cut off every way we had of reaching each other.

36
04:43.720 --> 04:45.520
They even lied to Liang Huan,

37
04:46.600 --> 04:49.280
telling her the baby died soon after birth.

38
04:56.320 --> 04:57.760
Later on...

39
04:59.120 --> 05:00.440
Song Yang

40
05:01.520 --> 05:03.120
brought the child back.

41
05:12.040 --> 05:13.960
He never let me see the boy...

42
05:16.720 --> 05:18.360
not until I gave in to him.

43
05:27.200 --> 05:28.400
I still remember

44
05:29.720 --> 05:31.240
my mother loved me so much.

45
05:32.520 --> 05:37.720
But she was always somewhere else alone, looking up at the sky.

46
05:42.960 --> 05:43.960
And then

47
05:44.960 --> 05:46.720
slowly, she just withered away.

48
05:48.320 --> 05:49.520
It was Song Yang!

49
05:50.080 --> 05:51.720
Song Yang and the rest of them!

50
05:52.720 --> 05:56.120
They conspired together to kill her!

51
05:57.760 --> 05:59.120
Are you satisfied now?

52
06:18.200 --> 06:19.200
Song Yi.

53
06:21.680 --> 06:23.200
Now that you know everything

54
06:25.720 --> 06:26.760
from now on

55
06:28.640 --> 06:30.320
you are never to speak of this again.

56
06:32.160 --> 06:33.160
Xu Feiyu

57
06:34.320 --> 06:35.960
is Liang Huan's son

58
06:37.000 --> 06:38.400
and he is my son too.

59
06:55.320 --> 06:57.240
I never gave you permission to come back.

60
06:58.320 --> 06:59.320
And from now on.

61
07:00.320 --> 07:02.200
I will certainly never allow

62
07:03.080 --> 07:05.520
what you feel for Xu Feiyu.

63
07:16.880 --> 07:22.120
Feiyu! Wow, so handsome!

64
07:39.680 --> 07:40.560
Hey, hey, hey.

65
07:40.561 --> 07:42.480
Feiyu, I have a question for you.

66
07:42.520 --> 07:44.079
After Song Yi got his sight back

67
07:44.080 --> 07:45.839
did he really never see your face?

68
07:45.840 --> 07:46.920
I have a question too.

69
07:47.120 --> 07:48.479
In the rest of the story

70
07:48.480 --> 07:50.359
will Feiyu go back to Song Yi?

71
07:50.360 --> 07:51.399
If Feiyu doesn't love Song Yi

72
07:51.400 --> 07:52.640
why did he leave?

73
07:53.120 --> 07:55.920
Could you tell us how the comic ends?

74
07:56.240 --> 07:57.280
Let me explain.

75
07:57.480 --> 07:59.279
The Xu Feiyu and Song Yi you see

76
07:59.280 --> 08:00.519
are characters I made up.

77
08:00.520 --> 08:01.400
And what you see

78
08:01.520 --> 08:03.160
is just a story I made up.

79
08:03.720 --> 08:06.079
I just didn't put my heart into drawing it

80
08:06.080 --> 08:07.080
so even now

81
08:07.081 --> 08:08.600
I still don't know how it ends.

82
08:09.920 --> 08:11.400
Um, I have one more question.

83
08:12.400 --> 08:12.880
Go ahead.

84
08:12.881 --> 08:14.759
Why is it that on the cover.

85
08:14.760 --> 08:16.120
Feiyu's face is blurred

86
08:16.320 --> 08:17.479
but inside the book

87
08:17.480 --> 08:18.720
it's your own face?

88
08:19.586 --> 08:20.586
Well...

89
08:20.760 --> 08:22.120
When I first created them

90
08:22.200 --> 08:23.560
I was going by their psychology.

91
08:24.040 --> 08:25.400
Since Song Yi couldn't see

92
08:25.760 --> 08:28.720
so in his eyes, Feiyu's face had to be a blur.

93
08:29.960 --> 08:30.720
It's just that

94
08:30.760 --> 08:31.760
later I felt

95
08:31.920 --> 08:33.240
they could never be apart.

96
08:33.720 --> 08:35.120
And to the two of them,

97
08:35.280 --> 08:37.160
they're the other half of each other.

98
08:38.280 --> 08:40.040
So I used my own image for all of them.

99
08:40.760 --> 08:42.280
It's as if in that world

100
08:42.840 --> 08:43.360
they

101
08:43.600 --> 08:44.600
are each other...

102
08:45.120 --> 08:46.120
they

103
08:46.240 --> 08:46.960
are one.

104
08:47.000 --> 08:49.640
Wow… that's fascinating…

105
08:49.720 --> 08:50.919
I sort of followed that

106
08:50.920 --> 08:51.920
and sort of didn't

107
08:52.080 --> 08:53.279
I don't really get it.

108
08:53.280 --> 08:54.680
Feiyu, sign this for me～

109
09:31.296 --> 09:33.756
[TN: If you look at the bottom right, you'll see the thin veneer of AI breaking mid-shot]

110
11:29.720 --> 11:30.120
Ah

111
11:30.240 --> 11:30.720
you're here

112
11:30.880 --> 11:31.520
great writer!

113
11:31.600 --> 11:32.720
How many times now

114
11:32.880 --> 11:34.079
I'm a comic artist.

115
11:34.080 --> 11:34.640
All right.

116
11:34.720 --> 11:36.016
Comic artist, what'll it be tonight?

117
11:36.040 --> 11:36.480
The usual!

118
11:37.000 --> 11:38.000
Knew you'd say that.

119
11:38.200 --> 11:38.480
Here.

120
11:38.560 --> 11:39.800
It's all ready for you.

121
11:40.320 --> 11:41.320
Thanks.

122
12:03.080 --> 12:04.080
Cheers!

123
13:01.000 --> 13:02.000
How is it?

124
15:28.480 --> 15:29.480
Xu Feiyu.

125
15:33.640 --> 15:37.880
Xu Feiyu… Xu Feiyu… Xu Feiyu.

126
15:37.960 --> 15:38.960
Ugh!

127
15:53.720 --> 15:54.840
Xu Feiyu.

128
16:00.520 --> 16:01.520
Xu Feiyu.

129
16:01.680 --> 16:02.680
Xu Feiyu!

130
16:05.480 --> 16:06.480
Xu Feiyu!

131
16:07.000 --> 16:08.000
Xu Feiyu!

132
16:09.600 --> 16:10.680
Xu Feiyu!

133
16:12.400 --> 16:13.400
Xu Feiyu.

134
16:14.400 --> 16:15.680
Where did you go, Xu Feiyu!

135
16:17.120 --> 16:18.560
Xu Feiyu!
